              Tevian Dray,
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Geometry of Differential Forms
              %a{:href => "http://physics.oregonstate.edu/coursewikis/GDF/"} web
          %p published as half of
          %ul
            %li
              Tevian Dray,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Differential Forms and the Geometry of General Relativity
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "http://physics.oregonstate.edu/coursewikis/DFGGR/bookinfo/"} web
          %p
            The equivalence between differential forms and smooth functors on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/path+groupoid"} path groupoid
            in low degree is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
