            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Toby+Bartels"} Toby Bartels
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Baez"} John Baez
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "https://groups.google.com/group/sci.physics.research/browse_thread/thread/6a231426b3a313c0/2888a120a9b1f5ad"} this giant Usenet thread
          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "https://groups.google.com/group/sci.physics.research/msg/3c6a1a7237b66c8c?dmode=source"} John's alter ego the Wizard
              explains why
              = succeed "-pseudoforms" do
