            %li
              %a{:href => "https://groups.google.com/group/sci.physics.research/msg/47bbd29289f208f8?dmode=source"} the general notion of form
              corresponding to an arbitrary representation of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/general+linear+group"} general linear group
              (towards the end of the post);
            %li
              %a{:href => "https://groups.google.com/group/sci.physics.research/msg/424da828e75b6b90?dmode=source"} absolute values of forms
